    {
      "id": "bda0db115e6be7d580f440193d0af73e67ae710f6edd54ec691c79074bc6b241",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4c49dcbcd2838bf1b2303eb510b2570cc0cb245ecdb9629baaac1fd3b495d37",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cfb0f198533bbc09ed7ff55b2b2bfe31ec67560a21ea9ac66dbf8412923377f7",
      "text": "You can use Vercel's AI SDK to connect to locally running models. In fact, not just locally running models but models running at any URL.",
      "hash": "3ba80e0bb7a79b85286f413cb78ba952a1d1eb5e72711029f0c1086ddb591bb5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ca1b19702bb60a00d51624228a11bbca49df5c42503e285674a00508f45f251",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c80acd5dabe3f62e76081d880e703c8e4a561ab58ac1da154d406140a7ed96",
      "text": "The AI SDK has a function called",
      "hash": "c8df7b98174fe9dc6bf2e12bb46356dd0534cbdae241f28f9f4bb0e34c65663b"
    },
    {
      "id": "10320792701fb150028d1a155b5ce126fa88c648b1536447676f012787ed4925",
      "text": "which lets you communicate with models that have an OpenAI-compatible API.",
      "hash": "1ac74b684af9f4db067aefc27a923ce2944ade9ed99c79bcdf367c941f86f02a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a335829740a04299a231a427340bf40448747bafac78feebc3c8de6fe852a020",
      "text": "In our case, I'm using an app called LM Studio which exposes this API on",
      "hash": "46e0023ae5408c625b09527860185505da58d412dc3889e090784183484dafdd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb6b6161bb78b71ca8fbd52e9af7a5c55b3c5e22f352e768a49be13b445f1fff",
      "text": "So I can install",
      "hash": "0a78651dc406cfc54ba94dd74e8c933ae3c990dcf9c7c379bacb88a751acc1a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "43fb1eea5c9d065931464a65aaa624cc13d9c1bbe1af73b7db67bb55001c13a6",
      "text": "and then create an LM Studio provider.",
      "hash": "40ffa0ffeb9fdee9ecc4af76364b2a659e36b13bcc50cdb4d830443e3047a1c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5daa7bdd29bfa358d065b0bf2722bfe39d3990f52c84abcfdde1573ca45e0cc7",
      "text": "And I can use this provider to grab a model.",
      "hash": "10800a5afa0d9ea07eb6b99a567a6c9f543314df3c6bc18cc7eb1c2e7df0f908"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfeb2df71c300e38f50ece1d6cebda0dda2e2f2d51b7807abedfb2491154fab3",
      "text": "I'm using an empty string here because if you pass an empty string it will default to choosing the model you have loaded in LM studio.",
      "hash": "ca25146b9670849342fb8a166b2c6fae200b3887c85861c8fc9e5008ca2813ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "61455dfd63209cfe0676961f2e9d570586ee77d0d36315c93117b6eb367f9303",
      "text": "I can then use this model by passing it into",
      "hash": "ef149d7d6c301672aa9b3a3c3ecfc3e4d2cc515acf406d051f68198de6cb4495"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc5bfd6f73a1b573e6fac4921639bb3f25bad42d285d56826defc99a2041d24f",
      "text": "I've specified",
      "hash": "73fb5a38076a4837e8d74fbbc2c7a54c4176c2447362140e59e965523ba67be3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1e1527551b11207837e66307f72c46edb21bd7dbab57df7fd93458980567883",
      "text": "as zero here. By default, the SDK will retry queries three times to make things more robust and handle any network issues.",
      "hash": "302dc54b11d67c997ac7a93f7669264d6a52045c71791fd6030238f53a9a799f"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2796f580d95d56e53d453b7af1748fa72a0618f57eeafa8b21e0712d548b621",
      "text": "But since the model is on our local network, we want it to fail instantly if it can't reach it.",
      "hash": "8eccbf86a9f3ea2cb86a1fe0a84a4cd6118d906b82a2aa3af104a6b6341d590a"
    },
    {
      "id": "58312d1d8f0c2dec34cffb0e5f0ae67d83155cb6788b09930dc619233d702be7",
      "text": "Let's give this a go. We're going to ask the LLM a story about its grandmother:",
      "hash": "311f95aa25f6daac5476759d449114ec7274fc79ea004ab13790bef6ceb7cd94"
    },
    {
      "id": "4de7dcdd62526fea9a537d74aef91902a44abf3327b71dc9520363d980536e42",
      "text": "And if we run it we get a story about the LLM's grandmother.",
      "hash": "7d01f65743643d2b53ce3f9e853898c48b45d4212379f69f5d3cf300766b132f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5db8e311a8ee5cab789bac613b2b100857fc236da31aa063aeac780b7915df8a",
      "text": "So this is a nice simple setup with how you can connect the Vercel AI SDK to a local model.",
      "hash": "0a20f8d8f85f1f575c99b16382e03d99f021d4900e388276f707b1d4d678348d"
    },
    {
      "id": "237d0c49c3db6e2c2932cdeb8edadee7efcd8acb2ebad4ea041d9bfb1579c646",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "a29425092d9ef6fcf93336162d356235d99c29664dac118f6dd2c6d4ffff2853",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8a612f493e6657977a9dc088043bddb421f8224f45581620c1b08fa6126c5da",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d99488b27341ad14dff3969f37e302beeb03b8e5cd57558429236284feaf017",
